# The record does not open a new activation: the space of `node` is one for the whole call (the book, node; the row node_if_body), so
# `node\hits := 6` inside the `L2:` record writes the field of the root and the method reads 6 through node after the record.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: hits 0
        int: r 0
)
int: hits 4
fn: f () int
    L2:
        node\hits := 6
    return: node\hits
int: r f()

sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\hits := node\hits
    shared\Observed\r := r
main()
